//   helper cost, so the branch explicitly increments steps by 1 if it performs
//   only repair, and in the repair+append subcase the append-driving helper
//   costs one and the branch still increments steps once. Thus returned cost can
//   soundly be set to steps at the end.
// progress: In both outside-span branches, generated grows by at most one token
